flowchart TB
    JOB["Private qualification request<br/>Contract, access and acceptance criteria"]:::main
    LOCK["Pinned environment manifest<br/>Tools, IP, board, clocks, build inputs"]:::store
    RUN["Isolated local worker<br/>Quotas, restricted network, licensed tools"]:::main
    RAW["Retained raw evidence<br/>Traces, logs, timings, calibration and counters"]:::store
    FUNC["Functional and proof scope checker"]:::check
    MET["Metric validator<br/>Boundary, samples, rates, drops and uncertainty"]:::check
    ID["Artifact hashes plus identity verification<br/>Signatures and independent review when present"]:::check
    E["Atlas-compatible evidence package<br/>Proposed ContractForge exporter"]:::store
    CMP["Qualified comparisons<br/>Reject incompatible semantics or controls"]:::check
    RELEASE["Private report or approved public subset<br/>No automatic disclosure of customer artifacts"]:::store
    CLAIM["Claim gate<br/>Measured, estimated, simulated or unresolved"]:::check
    JOB & LOCK --> RUN --> RAW
    RAW --> FUNC & MET & ID
    FUNC & MET & ID --> E --> CMP --> RELEASE --> CLAIM

